WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.640
There was a contest, a bit more than a
year now, it was the first

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:04.780
lockdown and I was like,

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:10.120
whoa, only sneaker design contest for
young designers and I

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:10.360
was like,

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:12.080
Why not?

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.260
At first I doubted myself, I was like, why
would I do this?

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:16.900
There's no way I can complete it this.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:22.480
I'm not even a newbie yet and then I was
like, it's free, what I'm

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.580
gonna lose from trying

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:28.720
and I tried and when I did it, I actually
submitted three different

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:29.020
designs.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.260
because I just had too many ideas at that
moment and I was like,

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.940
no I can't just submit one.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.320
I asked Clint before I would even know
him.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.000
Can I submit three designs? It was like,
yeah okay.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:45.060
A few weeks after I saw that I won and it
was like, oh, they came

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.020
out this July.
